## §0 TL;DR (per AGENTS.md §5.2 honest framing)

### What this document is

This is the **PRE_TRAINING_GATE_v2** design — a new layer of pre-training gates that augments
the existing **117 pre-flight gates** (`molmetal/scripts/pre_flight_check.py` lines 3142 +
gate count consistency auto-recompute per Wf-345-B3). The new gates ensure that:

1. **Post-training results are rigorously comparable** (per user directive 2026-10-02 verbatim
   *"我想要我们的模型在数据集上训练之后就能和Krasnov 2026 (MetalCytoToxDB) + Rusanov 2025 (PlatinAI) + DrugOOD 2022 严谨可比*") to the 3 Tier-1 baselines selected in `TODO/03_baselines/COMPARISON_BASELINES.md`.
2. **5 MOCK metrics are converted to REAL measurements** before any retrain launch —
   CPU-only feasible parts verified now; GPU-required parts verified post-launch (USER_OK-gated).
3. **3 honest-negative structural gates** (m2 R² / m6_kappa / m1 Re-fold) have pre-closure
   paths designed and ready.

### What this document is NOT

- **NOT** a reproduction protocol — per D-Wf-431 alignment 不是 reproduction; we use same
  dataset + same protocol + same metric; we do NOT replicate paper's k-fold seed or seed
  initialization. Protocol differences (5-fold CV vs scaffold-split) are documented in §6
  honest limitations.
- **NOT** a paper-writing contract — per `TODO-84 + AGENTS.md §5.3` no paper/* touches
  without USER_OK; this doc lives in `TODO/03_plans/` (project doc) + `docs/` (operator
  doc), NOT in `paper/`.
- **NOT** a wet-lab plan — per `AGENTS.md §5.4 + §10` Tier-2 reorientation + NO wet-lab
  planning per user directive 2026-09-29 + 2026-09-30; the 4 LOIs + 3 SOPs + IC50 pipeline
  are DEPRECATED.
- **NOT** a substitute for the existing 117 pre-flight gates — those gates remain INTACT;
  new gates are ADDITIVE.

### Core principle (verbatim from D-Wf-431)

> **我们不需要 reproduce 别人的数字 — 我们需要 same dataset + same protocol + same metric 来 make results comparable.**

### Gate layers (new layer is HIGHER than current 117 pre-flight gates)

| Layer | Count | When | Purpose |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Layer 0**: `molmetal/scripts/pre_flight_check.py` 117 gates | 117 | Pre-retrain | Hardware / data / config sanity |
| **Layer 1 (NEW)**: PRE_TRAINING_GATE_v2 Tier-1 must-pass | 8 (NEW) | Pre-retrain | Protocol + metric + dataset alignment gates |
| **Layer 2 (NEW)**: PRE_TRAINING_GATE_v2 Tier-2 recommended | 7 (NEW) | Pre-retrain | Recommended best-practice gates |
| **Layer 3 (NEW)**: MOCK→REAL verification gates | 5 (NEW) | Pre-retrain (CPU-only) + Post-retrain (GPU) | MOCK metric → REAL measurement |
| **Layer 4 (NEW)**: Honest-negative pre-closure gates | 3 (NEW) | Pre-retrain | m2 R² / m6_kappa / m1 Re-fold pre-closure paths |
| **Layer 5 (NEW)**: Per-baseline protocol validation hooks | 9 (NEW) | Post-retrain | Auto-computed per-seed + per-split statistics |

**Total new gates**: 8 Tier-1 + 7 Tier-2 + 5 MOCK→REAL + 3 honest-negative + 9 per-baseline = **32 NEW gates** (additive on existing 117).

**Expected total after this wave**: `EXPECTED_GATE_COUNTS["all"] = 117 + 32 = 149` (auto-recompute per Wf-345-B3 keeps the hardcoded count consistent).

